39	/// Batched linear decode kernels take a device array of pointers per linear
40	/// layer. The underlying `CudaSlice` allocations inside `RecurrentState` stay
41	/// at fixed device addresses for the request lifetime, so these tables should
42	/// be built once per slot/request and then reused across decode tokens.
